# Keeping the build context small is a security control as much as a speed
# one: .env, the venv and the real .fet file (which carries teacher names)
# must never enter an image layer, where they survive every later deletion.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.venv/
venv/
**/__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
htmlcov/
.coverage
*.fet
tests/
docs/
*.md
.git/
.gitignore
